# Early adb: bring up the USB gadget for adb from init, so a hung or slow
# system_server cannot block device diagnosis (USB config in a normal boot
# is driven by system_server UsbService late in boot).
# The device usb rc keys everything off sys.usb.config=adb (starts adbd +
# wires the UDC); this trigger fires as soon as `on boot` sets configfs=2.
# Unconditional: bring-up builds must always be diagnosable.
on property:sys.usb.configfs=2
    setprop sys.usb.config adb
